cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "rsa-nd: representational similarity analysis over any EEG/MEG features and dimensions"
type: software
abstract: >-
  rsa-nd extends MNE-Python and mne-rsa for representational similarity
  analysis over any EEG/MEG features and dimensions. Give it an MNE object or a
  named N-D array and say which axes to search over, such as space, frequency
  and time. It builds the feature tensor, runs the searchlight through mne-rsa,
  and returns a result that keeps its axis names and coordinates.
